# Derived governance status rollups — evicted from tracking 2026-07-04.
# They are rewritten in place with a generated_at timestamp on every run, so
# tracking them hard-conflicted every concurrent rebase train. Regenerate with
# scripts/governance/check_track_status.py (first three) and
# scripts/governance/trust_gate_status.py (fourth); CI publishes fresh copies
# to the generated/status branch on every push to main (active-track.yml).
reports/governance/active_track_evidence.json
reports/governance/active_track_evidence.md
reports/governance/track_portfolio.json
reports/governance/trust_gate_status.json

# Chamber chain-append advisory lock sidecars (ephemeral, never committed)
reports/governance/chamber/**/*.lock
